{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "8de5419c787577eb8655b04f6df78709774be426716fca26ae7c8a6e0cf3e57b", "ja": "小悪魔と夜の街♡", "zh": "小恶魔与夜晚的街道♡", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "eb59474aa8a065ae710ca49f4d5bf1e74209eebddf2fb9e1d59cdc4e4902d25d", "ja": "雪歩、美希、真、伊織は待ち合わせ中にナン\nパされる。だが、ユニット活動で得た小悪魔\n的な振る舞いでナンパ男を撃退。気をよくし\nて盛り上がる4人を見て、プロデューサーは\nユニットのこれからの活躍に想いを馳せた。", "zh": "雪步、美希、真和伊织在等制作人时被搭讪，\n然而四人利用在团体活动中学会的小恶魔举止\n顺利击退了搭讪男。看见四人因此开心地\n聊着相关话题，制作人不禁开始想像起\n这个团体今后的活跃发展。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1000_003mik", "source_sha256": "4e89f6a4d338551ad57875a850e6b4261d752c00ddb8be004c25d3ff87abe9b2", "ja": "あっ、いたいたっ。\n真くん、でこちゃん、お待たせなの～♪", "zh": "啊，找到了找到了。\n阿真、额头妹，让你们久等啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "0eb9ccd5addf30425ddc6f3bbc0377b2c2b6ae36114599aaab1af2c560cc5329", "ja": "でこちゃんって言うな！　……まったく、\n人を待たせておいて、他に言うことがないのかしら？", "zh": "别叫我额头妹！真是的，让人等了这么久，\n应该有其他的话该说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "49dbb62b38eaab93da92bbde41967950bb3a2af2465bc5a6c5694d792db14622", "ja": "ごめんなさい～。お仕事が長引いちゃって。\n急いで来たんだけど……。", "zh": "对不起～因为工作耽搁，\n我们已经尽快赶来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "3940893bc32c4dbe629efa57d070e2cf9efea14edf8d7abe2725863499ddf720", "ja": "大丈夫、ボク達もさっき来たばっかりだから。\nところで、{$P$}は一緒じゃないの？", "zh": "没事啦，我们也才刚到没多久。\n话说回来，{$P$}没有一起来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "1c792e462fd6c36202db02cd725090962acb06e923147ba914ba0189a5683344", "ja": "一緒に来たよ。車を停めてくるから、\n先に行ってって。", "zh": "有啊。\n他叫美希我们先过来，自己去停车了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9a199429ff6dd3b8925c504d66bf9d253d7a87fdddd308e9778b045769f16472", "ja": "そのままお店についたら、先に入っててって。", "zh": "他还叫我们到餐厅后先进去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "7fc3f82713965f38676c7cbb36df48744221d2ef9334f571ed6143b79e159f6a", "ja": "まあ、別に大丈夫じゃない？\nせっかくの打ち上げだし、ここで待っててあげましょ。", "zh": "不差这一点时间吧？\n难得大家开庆功宴，我们就在这里等他吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "5dcd9b52fc02d5dee887d4c5bb72281f3a93c420f33cbf0eb234d26ddbcf9f11", "ja": "その代わり、私達にふさわしいお店じゃなかったら\nただじゃおかないんだから。……にひひっ♪", "zh": "相对的，要是那间餐厅和我们不相衬，\n可不能轻易放过他……咿嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "6918aa23e79c253194e9a69905c02a061e2002e951b1208fa7cb61728591c61d", "ja": "それなら、期待していいんじゃないかな？\n今から行くの、雪歩のオススメのお店なんでしょ？", "zh": "在下觉得应该颇值得期待的。\n我们待会要去的餐厅，是雪步推荐的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f75c8b58675819285fdfa2a3c69314368727d3210b72b3a8cfeb4273c8914ec8", "ja": "うん。前に取材で行ったお店なんだけど、\nすごくステキだったんだ。それで……え？", "zh": "嗯，是之前接受采访时去的餐厅，\n真的非常棒喔，而且……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1010_nanpaotoko", "source_sha256": "7a021ce8689497dbb51474e8ed789530820ae70fd54138062d46f0e33235b0ef", "ja": "ねえねえ、君達、すっごくかわいいね。\n一緒に遊びに行かない？", "zh": "欸欸，你们超可爱的耶。\n要不要一起去玩？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7ea46ab4dcc1b24606e74e9a7b4caab9ef2e30e634d05cbcaa579ef0bae9554d", "ja": "ひうっ！？　お、お、男の人ですぅ！！", "zh": "咿呜！？陌、陌、陌生男人！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "8e17bddb1084b4dc6a881f2ae0bb924a3b0d5d227e0120452b16f19affb402b3", "ja": "これってもしかして……ナンパ！？", "zh": "这该不会是……搭讪！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "4d49b3f4793892efb7b99b70d6df63bec2a2e381f8d0558a876d19fb65de4bd1", "ja": "（ちょっと……どうするのよ、これ？\n早く何とかしないと面倒よ）", "zh": "（我说……现在该怎么办啊？\n要是不快点想办法解决，会很麻烦的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "9fb4e0089f8d1299b91b3f9a47fd388ce01ef84cf11a7f8e6fbe30627d7f92ba", "ja": "（ん～。それじゃ、みんなで走って逃げちゃう？）", "zh": "（嗯～那大家一起逃走吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "30dcbbf80711c728944af46b73d3252ff0b9e1e9f76f6f62e45b63febdd65bce", "ja": "（逃げ切れるかしら……。\nもう、仕方ないわね。奥の手よ！）", "zh": "（我们逃得掉吗……\n唉，真没办法，使出最后手段吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "96f93b38d8a93e2f5b8ffee983e149f722695b893aa0984dea5fa2ac38d4c5b7", "ja": "（い、伊織ちゃん？　奥の手って……）", "zh": "（伊、伊织？最后手段是指……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "a8062c66a753f5bde8a780852980fc2e5c5f05086c5e64e738648b086d51f1bb", "ja": "（ちょっと私に合わせてちょうだい。\nいい？　私達の実力を見せるんだから！）", "zh": "（大家稍微配合我一下。\n准备好了没？让他见识见识我们的实力！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1018_nanpaotoko", "source_sha256": "eddff27158bb82ce130c5cb4f9348a86918cce79f0fda75ae59b4b049d15c2b9", "ja": "おっ、遊びに行く気になった？", "zh": "哦？愿意一起去玩了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "1234ab0f425a5f3c964f229b8b2b373a9729d60f9b86cb7453fbba043f720e34", "ja": "いいわよ……。でも、私達を誘うくらいだから、\nと～っても高級なお店に連れて行ってくれるのよね～？", "zh": "可以是可以……不过，既然你有本事邀请我们，\n应该会带我们去非～常高级的餐厅吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1020_nanpaotoko", "source_sha256": "af14ad2eb512d1daddff043f49f126f308ffa939b2a2aa1b6b57159abbbe4292", "ja": "えっ……。い、いや、そんなに金、\n持ってるわけじゃないんだけど……。", "zh": "呃……这、这个，\n我身上没有那么多钱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "1af0c0c31bd97e1dbd1666302aaa2d31231473b133c1425af3fdb3a1f51b191f", "ja": "え～！　ボク達、これからパーティーなんだよ。でも、\nもっといいとこなら、行ってもよかったのにな～。", "zh": "咦～！我们正要去参加派对耶。\n如果你能带我们去更棒的地方，也不是不能跟你走啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1022_nanpaotoko", "source_sha256": "173a8b08941f8f0fd82e782d12722911d7a9a4721a7224dc9ff2789bfca9de71", "ja": "そ、そんなこと言わずにさぁ……。\nそっちの彼女もダメ？　ねえ、一緒に遊ぼうよ。", "zh": "别、别这么说嘛……那位小姐也不行吗？\n怎么样？一起去玩吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "e232df867fb71966af0d333adaed6730498eb347323cade1a3130f55fa5d77dc", "ja": "ミキね、ハニー以外の男の人とは、遊ばないの♪\nだから、一緒に行くことはないって思うな♪", "zh": "美希不打算跟HONEY以外的男人玩唷♪\n所以，美希不想跟你走呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1024_nanpaotoko", "source_sha256": "0f468c720044c9d79208c833310b47e7c4198035cfbf87524c411915abffccd3", "ja": "え？　ハニーって、誰？", "zh": "咦？HONEY是谁啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "5c6fe688da89b4d8bfa51bedc53b9cb7c77da350374c46b5c39c7f9238f4d446", "ja": "（ほら、雪歩もやってみて……）", "zh": "（来吧，雪步也试试看……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1026_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6ceb9cef23b4f6508e710c5a57128da46f0b4531d6991e7bcf1d510058024698", "ja": "（う、うん……）", "zh": "（好、好的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c6edbbb154fc95906d350222ef7c38dab93cc5a5ecf9c2124ffe6c78d2b47d38", "ja": "じゃ、じゃあ……これでバイバイね。\nもうすぐ、か、彼氏が迎えにきちゃうからっ。", "zh": "那、那么……差不多该说拜拜啰。\n我的男、男朋友马上就要来接我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1028_nanpaotoko", "source_sha256": "86262b9972fd767f49f6ebc72fe673dfb82a3d96e59f622d4b2be26686a2b56a", "ja": "えっ！　彼氏持ちなの……！？", "zh": "咦！已经有男朋友了吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c964c39752916bd6479610929c2b37ca7952637f9e367524c14726f01d1ab8f2", "ja": "みんな、遅くなってすまない……、と……。\n……あの、すみません、どちらさまで……？", "zh": "各位，抱歉来迟了……呃……\n……那个，不好意思，请问你是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1030_nanpaotoko", "source_sha256": "0b52b7ae2819864d59b3799d9b5746a6eff11259d79bf35ca0c5c0179fc429c7", "ja": "さ、さようなら～～～！！", "zh": "打、打扰了～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "7aa5b2ebc58f5977a67f8cc99f14be993cfcdb07534e1be2eb34e33f9d43e609", "ja": "……あ、行ってしまった……。\nなんだったんだ？", "zh": "……啊，走掉了……\n怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1032_003mik", "source_sha256": "1d8e0968306a7ac2d83739fedea9bb377f204de344b1b431524b2e4df7c8ea39", "ja": "むー。{$P$}、遅いの！", "zh": "唔～{$P$}，你太慢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1033_007ior", "source_sha256": "f55b09972d6ea8ec82284a1bc7b055e4c28a061184addd2324440d13ffd38ceb", "ja": "アンタが遅いせいでナンパされたじゃない！\nアイドルに何かあったらどうするつもりなのよ！？", "zh": "都是你太慢，害我们被搭讪了啦！\n要是我们这群偶像出了什么事，你要怎么负责啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "7aa798290b73faa2b3bde7fcf71550615f63df27800d134e78391504ef88e5e0", "ja": "な、ナンパ？　だ、大丈夫だったか？\n一緒に行動した方がよかったな……。", "zh": "搭、搭讪？你、你们没事吧？\n早知道应该跟你们一起行动的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1035_006mak", "source_sha256": "24b71bb9775c9d2b21d7370b9f0e4ccbba5a6441b29d62047b15b6c8ed7edb02", "ja": "へへ～。大丈夫でしたよ、{$P$}。\nボク達の小悪魔な魅力で、撃退しちゃいましたから！", "zh": "嘿嘿～没事喔，{$P$}。\n我们用小恶魔的魅力把他赶跑了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1036_004yuk", "source_sha256": "18cc7f891f842437a74955aacf0a8382747dfdd913cb8aa9f5bffe8285790b21", "ja": "うう……き、緊張しましたぁ……。\nけど、なんだか達成感もあって……。", "zh": "呜呜……刚、刚刚真的好紧张……\n不过，莫名地有成就感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1037_003mik", "source_sha256": "9670e0cbb7557cbec7401450a4a4c3b6049ad76161c10582d6b4a7b9cda9aa65", "ja": "雪歩、とっても大胆だったの☆\nもうすぐ、彼氏が来るって！", "zh": "雪步刚才很大胆唷☆\n还说「男朋友就快来了」！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1038_p", "source_sha256": "fa5a2e6f2a960b6f18fc2206bbabdd7ed4ef665031f26b480f58d21b977e66f0", "ja": "え？　彼氏って……？", "zh": "咦？男朋友……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1039_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ebe7c269f7822c7d115a76d16f5a4455c639a9d69f1d78c5bc36fc9cb1cc0261", "ja": "そ、それは……とっさに出た言葉で……。\nあうう、穴掘って埋まってますぅ～！", "zh": "那、那是……我临时想到的借口……\n啊呜呜，我要挖洞把自己埋起来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1040_007ior", "source_sha256": "1776522b510781e8ab1ef4319f22e06eb6114dbb1c6f930ba8d7ce7f2dc3ca40", "ja": "あれが決め手になったのよね。\n大活躍だったじゃない、雪歩♪", "zh": "那句话成了赶跑他的关键呢。\n你立了大功喔，雪步♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1041_003mik", "source_sha256": "a4ebf058678c88819d34bea92b18af951d9c0c27aa7cfc5e25723d4af249f45b", "ja": "さあ、それじゃあ、みんなで打ち上げに出発なのー☆", "zh": "好啦，那么大家就出发去庆功宴吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1042_007ior", "source_sha256": "028a2e112b1a09a92eb09cbf532a3b0fb3e41db8d8fb65ff1eb1853cfb1bedbd", "ja": "今日はいっぱい楽しんで、\n明日からはまた、特訓ね♪", "zh": "今天要尽情享受，\n明天再继续开始特训♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1043_006mak", "source_sha256": "152c6a83e2c70ab4a72fdc109de2ebecc6646725f8a030e0b68650de4ce62135", "ja": "そうだね！　セクシー小悪魔ユニットとして、\n悩殺する特訓をしなきゃ！", "zh": "说得对！我们是性感小恶魔团体，\n必须进行迷倒观众的特训才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1044_p", "source_sha256": "e63ef84dc949cc83fe4b9ae204f2f84f1b6e5d71fa82e1a5edc4b5f32c4c9bfd", "ja": "なるほど、今度は悩殺する特訓か……ん？\nもしかして、その特訓の相手役は……", "zh": "原来如此，这次是迷倒观众的特训啊……嗯？\n陪练的对象该不会是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1045_006mak", "source_sha256": "19c6df2a95580410641994fce3be97b6e54337fce9c3fe6f0bd7d84e07642034", "ja": "もっちろん、{$P$}です！", "zh": "当然是{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0098_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_07_1046_007ior", "source_sha256": "385e55d6c0e8d89423847462ba8c12d473d5aa4d0b7871d4071b3c3bfdfdc764", "ja": "もっちろん、{$P$}よ！", "zh": "当然是{$P$}啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
